Vendored web fonts (latin subsets only), fetched once from Google Fonts on
2026-09-10 and served locally so the browser works offline — no CDN at runtime,
the same rule as echarts.min.js.

  SourceSerif4-600.woff2   Source Serif 4, weight 600  — headings
  SourceSerif4-400i.woff2  Source Serif 4, italic 400  — pull quotes / emphasis
  IBMPlexMono-400.woff2    IBM Plex Mono, weight 400   — numbers, identifiers
  IBMPlexMono-500.woff2    IBM Plex Mono, weight 500   — emphasized numbers

Both families are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(Source Serif 4 © Adobe; IBM Plex Mono © IBM). Body text uses the system UI
face on purpose; only the display and data faces are shipped.
